    "updated_at": "2025-02-14T13:02:17Z",
    "body": "My comment on #295 still generally holds: I'm not against this, but I'm more interested in expanding support for Java 1.0 labels (except the pattern found to be Web-incompatible by Presto-era Opera), but I'm also not volunteering to research their Web compat status. I meant to r+ this yesterday, but given the removal from Chromium, I'm now interested in hearing @ricea 's report of how that experience went. If the removal from Chromium was uneventful, perhaps we don't need this.",
